"Syl is a Chimeric Cluster Slime (Prismatic) of tier five, the only slime of her kind."
"Syl was hatched as a blue slime on a Stantondale farm; a child nearly cut her into a jar."
"Syl's first core was crimson; she later lost it, and her current main core feels the same."
"Syl evolved four times, through Mimic Slime and Cluster Slime, and is now racial level 19."
"Syl needs racial level 50 for her next evolution, and dislikes the Slime Queen path."
"Syl hoped to become a time slime, but conditioning herself with time spells failed."
"Syl has eaten pink, blue, green, purple, red, white, yellow, orange, silver and violet cores."
"Syl has also eaten brown and black cores; she still lacks gray, gold and copper."
"All of Syl's colours are merged into one trait, Primordial Slime, now level 19."
"Primordial Slime lets impossible alloys hold while willed, and blends every slime instantly."
"Syl smelts Blaze and Metal Slime to double real metal, up to half slime by weight."
"Syl's Metal Slime forges deepstone, mithril, orichalcum, adamantine and Truesilver."
"Syl holds all 24 Sub-Cores, the most any slime may have."
"Syl keeps three working slime networks: her own, one on Tanglebay, and one in Keld."
"Syl's personas are Sylvain, Sylbera, Sylvester and Sylthaeryn, each run by Sub-Cores."
"Syl has twenty-four personas in all now, played through her many cores."
"Sub-Core Pi stays on Tanglebay; it was crushed over and over for pink and blue shards."
"Syl hides her pink core shards and saves them as rewards for her future dungeon."
"Syl leaves Mana Slime vials in the Southbrook pens; she is the god of slimes they seek."
"Syl's slime might revive her through a persona's Sub-Core if her main core dies."
"Syl plans a slime dungeon to spawn slimes, study their evolutions, and eat them."
"Syl ranks eating a new slime core as her favourite delicacy."
"Gramps gave Syl a list of slime kinds to hunt down."
"Gramps may be blocking reliable passive mass gain for Syl's slime."
"Cursed ice from wendigo claws freezes Syl's jelly past her Cryo Slime immunity."
